    // ---- Limitations ----
    const Lm = zh() ? [
      '数据起点受限：SMH 与 VGT 的日频数据只从 2006-09-29 开始（SMH 现 ETF 2011 年成立，此前为 HOLDRS；VGT 缺少 2004–2006 年的日频数据）；纳指100 日频从 1999 年 QQQ 上市开始；SPY 从 1995 年开始。比较长期指标时请注意起点不同。',
      '指数与 ETF 不同：标普500 指数不含费用；ETF 含费用与现金拖累。SPY 相对指数每年约少 0.1 个百分点。',
      'SOXX 两次更换跟踪指数（2010-10-15 由 IGW 改名并改为费城半导体指数，2021 年改为 ICE 半导体指数），SMH 在 2011 年由 HOLDRS 转换而来，因此它们的早期历史对应的是不同的投资组合。',
      Core.rfThrough ? '国库券利率最后几个交易日沿用最新公布值，直到财政部公布下一个数值；CPI 在最新公布月份之后保持不变；两者对结果的影响可以忽略。' : '无风险利率在 2025-12-19 之后以联邦基金目标利率中值近似，CPI 在最新月份之后保持不变；两者对结果的影响可以忽略。',
      '回测结果对起止日期很敏感。请使用“稳健性检验”查看结论在不同起点下是否成立，并警惕把参数调到最优后的过度拟合。',
      '历史收益不代表未来。1928 年以来美国股市是全球表现最好的市场之一（“幸存者”），其他国家的长期结果可能差很多。',
      '目标规划是用历史月度收益重新洗牌，不是预测：默认样本（1999 年以来）正好是美国大盘股、尤其是科技股表现很好的年代，算出的达标概率和安全提取率可能偏乐观——页面同时给出标普500 最长历史作为参照。不含税费与换汇成本。',
      '芯片个股只包含今天仍存在、而且很大的公司；历史上倒下的存储与芯片公司不在样本里，所以“大跌后买入”的结果和收复时间都偏乐观。',
      '通胀环境研究（研究 R11）只有很少的独立区段——通胀高于 3% 的月份大多集中在 1973–91 年——并且使用月平均价格与代理数据（合成国债、世界银行金价）；它描述的是过去，不是择时信号。',
      '2010 年以前的 SOXL* 与 TQQQ* 是模拟值，不是真实交易记录：模型假设模拟段的成本与校准期相同，并且以 SOXL 和 TQQQ 实际跟踪的指数为底；SOXX 在 2010-10-15 以前（当时为 IGW）跟踪的是另一个半导体指数，所以模拟段的 SOXL* 与同期 SOXX 并非严格的 3 倍关系（本站用 SOXX* 作比较）。',
    ] : [
      'Limited starts: SMH and VGT daily data begin 2006-09-29 (the current SMH ETF launched in 2011, HOLDRS before; VGT lacks 2004–06 daily data); the Nasdaq-100 daily series begins with QQQ in 1999; SPY in 1995. Mind the different starts when comparing long-run numbers.',
      'Index vs ETF: the S&P 500 index has no costs; ETFs carry fees and cash drag. SPY trails the index by about 0.1 pp a year.',
      'SOXX changed its index twice (on 2010-10-15, when IGW was renamed SOXX and moved to the PHLX Semiconductor index, and in 2021 to the ICE Semiconductor Index) and SMH converted from HOLDRS in 2011, so their early histories reflect different portfolios.',
      Core.rfThrough ? 'The last few sessions of the T-bill rate carry the latest published value until the Treasury publishes the next one, and CPI is held flat after the latest published month; both effects are negligible.' : 'After 2025-12-19 the risk-free rate is approximated by the Fed funds target midpoint, and CPI is held flat after the latest month; both effects are negligible.',
      'Backtests are sensitive to start and end dates. Use the robustness test to see whether a conclusion survives other start dates, and beware of overfitting tuned parameters.',
      'Past returns do not predict future ones. Since 1928 the US has been one of the best-performing markets in the world (a “survivor”); long-run results elsewhere have been much worse.',
      'The Goal Planner reshuffles historical monthly returns; it does not forecast. The default sample (since 1999) was kind to US large caps, tech above all, so success probabilities and safe withdrawal rates may lean optimistic — the page shows the S&P 500\'s full history as a reference. Taxes, fees and conversion costs are ignored.',
      'The chip stocks are only today\'s large survivors; memory and chip makers that failed are not in the sample, so results after big falls and recovery times are flattered.',
      'The inflation-regime study (Research R11) rests on few independent episodes — most months with inflation above 3% fall in 1973–91 — and uses monthly-average prices and proxies (synthetic Treasuries, World Bank gold); it describes the past and is not a timing signal.',
      'SOXL* and TQQQ* before 2010 are simulations, not trading records: the model assumes the same costs as in the calibration window and uses the indexes SOXL and TQQQ actually track; until 2010-10-15 SOXX (then IGW) tracked a different semiconductor index, so in the simulated years SOXL* is not exactly 3× SOXX (the site compares it with SOXX* instead).',
    ];
    el.appendChild(section({ zh: '六、局限与免责声明', en: '6. Limitations & disclaimer' }, h('ul', { class: 'prose' }, Lm.map(x => h('li', null, x))), h('p', { class: 'callout warn' }, t('footer1'))));
